src/n7_toms708.c is R's src/nmath/toms708.c (R 4.6.0), with bratio()
renamed n7_bratio() and the R headers replaced by src/n7_nmath.h. It is
R's C translation of ACM TOMS Algorithm 708 by Armido R. Didonato and
Alfred H. Morris, Jr. (ACM Transactions on Mathematical Software 18,
360-373, 1992), with changes by the R Core Team, and is distributed with R
under the GNU General Public License, version 2 or any later version.

src/n7_bessel_k.c is R's src/nmath/bessel_k.c (R 4.6.0), with bessel_k()
removed, bessel_k_ex() renamed n7_bessel_k_ex() and the R headers replaced
by src/n7_nmath.h and the constants of R's src/nmath/bessel.h. It is the
routine RKBESL of W. J. Cody and L. Stoltz (netlib specfun), after J. B.
Campbell, translated to C by Martin Maechler:
  Copyright (C) 1998-2014 Ross Ihaka and the R Core Team
  Copyright (C) 2002-3 The R Foundation
  Copyright (C) 2001-2026 R Core Team (the constants of bessel.h)
src/bessel_k.cpp's n7_bessel_k() is R's bessel_k() with its work array on
the stack.

